    "text": "konklife.com\nwebsite\nKey West\nGreen Drinks Key West: Networking for a Healthier, Sustainable Future\nBy KONK Life Editor,\n2 days agoJoin the City of Key West for Green Drinks from 5:30 to 7 p.m. on Tuesday, August 19th at the Side Bar, 504 Angela St. This is a fantastic opportunity to connect with individuals who share your passion for creating a positive impact on the planet and the community to collaborate to build a more sustainable future.",
